WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.090
“Where do I rank?”

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:02.821
Every local client asks.

00:00:02.841 --> 00:00:04.724
You check, and it says number one.

00:00:04.744 --> 00:00:05.914
But that's one street.

00:00:05.984 --> 00:00:07.204
Two kilometres away,

00:00:07.224 --> 00:00:08.975
nobody finds the business.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:10.175
One number can't show that.

00:00:10.195 --> 00:00:12.470
MarkerRank shows the whole map.

00:00:12.675 --> 00:00:14.146
Search for the business.

00:00:16.425 --> 00:00:17.765
Pick a keyword and a grid,

00:00:17.785 --> 00:00:19.145
then run the scan.

00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:23.835
Every point gets checked,

00:00:23.855 --> 00:00:25.315
and the heat map fills in.

00:00:25.335 --> 00:00:26.655
Green near the business,

00:00:26.675 --> 00:00:27.897
red further out.

00:00:27.975 --> 00:00:30.281
Now you see which
streets lose customers.

00:00:30.475 --> 00:00:32.295
One click makes a white label PDF,

00:00:32.315 --> 00:00:34.388
in your client's language.

00:00:34.408 --> 00:00:35.933
Or send a share link.

00:00:37.408 --> 00:00:38.548
One flat monthly price,

00:00:38.568 --> 00:00:41.550
from €29. Hosted in the EU.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:43.310
Start your free 14-day trial.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:44.861
No card required.
